{"summary":"码头枪杀案中枪上出现第三枚指纹，嫌疑人指向毛利小五郎的前上司寺冈警部。","sources":["src-detective-conan-world-third-fingerprint-case"],"relatedEpisodes":["episode-0064"],"culprit":{"zhHans":"寺冈警部（Inspector Teraoka），警视厅搜查四课管理官，毛利小五郎的前上司。","en":null,"translationStatus":"human","translationSourceHash":"da39a3ee5e6b"},"motive":{"zhHans":"松山以揭发寺冈收受贿赂、泄露警方行动情报为把柄勒索他，并索要资金以便从自己犯下的另一起杀人案中脱身、逃往国外，寺冈因此杀死松山。","en":null,"translationStatus":"human","translationSourceHash":"da39a3ee5e6b"},"method":{"zhHans":"寺冈在码头枪杀松山，试图把案件引向抢劫或意外方向；他随身携带的配枪藏在裤下枪套里，因此进入车内时发出金属碰撞声。","en":null,"translationStatus":"human","translationSourceHash":"da39a3ee5e6b"},"evidence":{"zhHans":"枪上出现的第三枚指纹属于寺冈的妻子美沙子，她无意中碰到寺冈藏起来的枪；柯南从寺冈上车时听到的异常金属声判断他使用的是自己的枪。","en":null,"translationStatus":"human","translationSourceHash":"da39a3ee5e6b"},"resolution":{"zhHans":"柯南查明第三枚指纹来自误触配枪的美沙子，也确认寺冈为灭口而杀人；寺冈在毛利面前承认受贿被勒索的事实。","en":null,"translationStatus":"human","translationSourceHash":"da39a3ee5e6b"},"deepSpoilers":true,"detailStatus":"deepSpoilers","updatedAt":"2026-10-27","dcwPage":"The_Third_Fingerprint_Murder_Case","castNames":["Conan Edogawa","Kogoro Mouri","Ran Mouri","Juzo Megure","Kamen Yaiba"],"solvedBy":"Kogoro Mouri (via Conan)","dcwAirDate":"June 23, 1997","dcwFillerCaseNumber":"#24","victims":[{"name":"Matsuyama","causeOfDeath":"Gunshot wound","causeOfDeathZh":"枪击致死","nameZh":"松山"}],"suspects":["Inspector Teraoka"],"caseFactsSource":"The_Third_Fingerprint_Murder_Case","suspectsZh":["寺冈警部"]}